 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Keep it in the bed of your car, parked somewhere quiet overnight. A blanket over the box helps keep the aromas out. Blocks are great and don't need cutting. An ice chest is better though, if you do cutting in the kitchen. Ice keeps it cold all weekend. Keep a layer of ice on top of the cold food, and don't let it stay out for too long. Let him keep an eye on it with a friend instead, or use the ice chest. An ice box won't last a full weekend. You can, and it' worth it for long weekends. Just fill a big jug for the whole weekend.",
